        {"zh": "我的女王在等待你。", "en": "My queen awaits you."},
        {"zh": "来吧，我蜜脾味的伴侣。", "en": "Come, my honeycomb-scented mate."},
        {"zh": "我的女王需要你。", "en": "My queen needs you."},
        {"zh": "来和我一起繁殖。", "en": "Come, breed with me."},
        {"zh": "你是我的未来！", "en": "You are my future."},
        {"zh": "我的女王，等待继承人。", "en": "My queen, waiting for heirs."},
        {"zh": "和我一起统治这片土地。", "en": "Rule this land with me."},
        {"zh": "来吧，和我共筑梦想。", "en": "Come, build dreams with me."},
        {"zh": "我的女王需要强壮的王。", "en": "My queen needs a strong king."}
