        {"zh": "蜜脾，我唯一的希望。", "en": "Honeyblock, my only hope."},
        {"zh": "怪异肉，巢穴的精华。", "en": "Mutated meat, the hive's essence."},
        {"zh": "吃掉蜜脾，享受甜蜜。", "en": "Taste the honeyblock, enjoy its sweetness."},
        {"zh": "怪异肉，滋养我的力量。", "en": "Mutated meat feeds my strength."}
      ]
